- Update to 0.3.0:
  * Applications by origin and discover by theme
  * Web sources: fixed addresses and download pages besides GitHub
  * Repository health check, cards view and Flatpak remotes
  * Search the openSUSE Build Service, Fedora COPR and Flathub

